OL,3,AMan denies racist murder of scientist
OL,4,Ain Dundee as trial date set for 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied the
OL,7,Fracially-aggravated murder of a
OL,8,Fscientist on a Dundee street.
OL,10,FKyler Rattray, 21, is accused of
OL,11,Fattacking Dr Fortune Gomo in South
OL,12,FStreet in July last year.
OL,14,FProsecutors allege the 39-year-old
OL,15,Facademic was repeatedly struck on the
OL,16,Fbody with a knife and that the attack
OL,17,Fwas aggravated by prejudice relating to
OL,18,Frace, colour nationality or ethnicity.
OL,20,FThe trial is due to begin on 5 January
OL,21,F2028 at the High Court in Dundee and is
OL,22,Fexpected to last eight days.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
